dness - and by the secret of Arion's birth. A mysterious stranger spirits Arion away, and seeks to shape the growing young man into an assassin, a secret weapon to tilt the balance of the war between Zeus and Poseidon. But Arion won't be manipulated easily, nor will he submit quietly to the hands of adversaries like the tenacious Ares, the intelligent and fierce Athena, or the elegant and scheming Apollo. Only his tremendous strength, a forgotten weapon forged by Prometheus, and the love and loyalty of his allies can carry Arion forward. To discover the secret of his destiny, Arion will have to storm Mount Olympus- and face down Zeus himself!\n\n(Source: Discotek Media)"},"tags":[{"name":"Gods","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anti-Hero","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Crossdressing","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Neo Heroic Fantasia Arion","english":"Neo Heroic Fantasia Arion","native":"ネオ・ヒロイック・ファンタジア　アリオン","romaji":"Neo Heroic Fantasia: Arion","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"アリオン"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"亚里安"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Arion"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}